 of sunny days (256 annually), and its climate comfort is rated highly at 84 out of 100.\\n\\nAnswer: Sausalito has mild weather with an average high of around 69°F in July and an average low of 43°F in January. It receives 34 inches of rain annually over 56 days, with no snowfall and 256 sunny days per year. The climate is considered comfortable, with a comfort index of 84 out of\"]", "time_sec": 298.366, "generation_time_seconds": 298.3621, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0004, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 34.78, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
