not contain any information about the location of Dove soap headquarters. They only include contact information for customer service and a statement about Dove's philosophy on beauty and care.\\n\\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.\", \"The provided passages do not contain any information about the location of Dove soap headquarters. The passages only provide contact information for customer service and include a statement about Dove's philosophy on beauty and care.\\n\\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.\"]", "time_sec": 41.274, "generation_time_seconds": 41.2705, "selection_time_seconds": 0.0001, "eval_metrics": {"Token-F1": 5.61, "GAVIE-Rel": -1.0, "GAVIE-Acc": -1.0, "Status": "success"}}
